{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","星光之舞"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","为全体友军大幅提升急速，并使“星界牵绊”内的友军霸体。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，伊莱亚和莱拉在战斗中会各自独立行动并共享生命值与能量，且最大生命值提高50%。\n主动使用时，二人会一同起舞，为全体友军提升60 + 4点急速，持续7秒。本技能持续时间内，二人还会使“星界牵绊”内的所有友军获得霸体。本技能仅当伊莱亚处于可以使用终极技能的状态下时才能使用。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":108,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的效果持续时间提高至7.5秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的效果持续时间提高至8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的效果持续时间提高至8.5秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的效果持续时间提高至9秒。"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","星界牵绊"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","二人沿连线向彼此发射祝福，分别为途经的友军恢复生命值与能量。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","布阵时，伊莱亚和莱拉之间会形成一道“星界牵绊”。若伊莱亚和莱拉刚好在同一条直线路径上，则还会与布阵在二人中间的所有友方英雄建立“星界牵绊”。“星界牵绊”内的友军永久获得25%攻击力提升，但布阵阶段每多连接一名友军，该攻击力提升效果便会降低5%。\n主动使用时，伊莱亚沿“星界牵绊”向莱拉传递一团金色光芒，为途经的每位“星界牵绊”内的友军恢复30 + 4点能量；莱拉沿“星界牵绊”向伊莱亚传递一份绿色光芒，为途经的每位“星界牵绊”内的友军恢复-100% − 10% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":171,"end":175,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":224,"end":230,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"keyword:standardline"},{"start":219,"end":234,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚恢复的能量值提高至35 + 4点，莱拉恢复的生命值提高至-110% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚恢复的能量值提高至40 + 4点，莱拉恢复的生命值提高至-120% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚恢复的能量值提高至45 + 4点，莱拉恢复的生命值提高至-130% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","携手互助"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚为友军施加护盾，莱拉对友军身边的敌人造成伤害和致盲。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚为莱拉和另外1名最虚弱的友军施加150% + 15% ATK护盾，持续4 + 0.4秒，并使莱拉在护盾持续期间获得霸体；\n莱拉在伊莱亚和另外1名身边有敌人的友军所处位置召唤星界冲击，对1格范围内的敌人造成110% + 10% ATK伤害和持续4 + 0.4秒的致盲，并将伊莱亚身边的敌人击退1格。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":109,"end":115,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":125,"end":131,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":105,"end":119,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":133,"end":135,"tooltip_key":"keyword:blind"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚施加的护盾值提高至160% + 15% ATK，莱拉的星界冲击伤害提高至120% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚施加的护盾值提高至170% + 15% ATK，莱拉的星界冲击伤害提高至130% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伊莱亚施加的护盾值提高至180% + 15% ATK，莱拉的星界冲击伤害提高至140% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，当自身释放终极技能后使“星界牵绊”内的友军额外提高急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，伊莱亚和莱拉提高9点急速。每当伊莱亚和莱拉释放终极技能，便会使“星界牵绊”内的所有友军永久提高3点急速，最多叠加3层。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，伊莱亚和莱拉提高12点急速。每当伊莱亚和莱拉释放终极技能，便会使“星界牵绊”内的所有友军永久提高4点急速，最多叠加3层。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，伊莱亚和莱拉提高15点急速。每当伊莱亚和莱拉释放终极技能，便会使“星界牵绊”内的所有友军永久提高5点急速，最多叠加3层。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","共鸣回音"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“星界牵绊”中的所有其他友军均来自统一阵营时，“星界牵绊”将会获得更加强大的增益效果，并可在其中友军全部释放终极技能后获得永久强化。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若“星界牵绊”内除伊莱亚和莱拉以外的所有友军均来自同一阵营，则会使“星界牵绊”获得“共鸣”效果。在“共鸣”效果影响下，“星界牵绊”额外提升其中友军10点受愈与10%能量获取速度，并且当“星界牵绊”中的每一名友军均释放过终极技能后，“星界牵绊”将会爆发出永久性的能量激荡来鼓舞全体友军，使场上所有友军在每次释放终极技能之后返还10%的能量消耗。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","在“共鸣”效果影响下，“星界牵绊”提供的受愈提高至25点、能量获取速度提高至12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","在“共鸣”效果影响下，“星界牵绊”提供的受愈提高至40点、能量获取速度提高至14%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“星界牵绊”爆发出能量激荡后，全体友军在每次释放终极技能之后返还的能量消耗比例提高至15%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“星界牵绊”内的友军会按照一定比例共享属性值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“星界牵绊”中的每一名友军获得攻击力、护甲与魔抗提升，数值为“星界牵绊”内其他友军对应属性最高者的15%。提升的部分最高不超过伊莱亚和莱拉对应属性初始值的30%，且通过本效果提升的属性不会再次参与到本效果的计算中。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","心灵轻羽"]]}